        "original_id": "d628c2a6-d1a2-5ea5-ba9c-67c4315140fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Quzhou, Hubei Province, Zhejiang Province, China\n- People: Trần Ích Tắc\n- Organizations: Yuan Dynasty\n- Roles: prefecture-level city, King of Annam\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- Quzhou is a prefecture-level city in western Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- After another failed Yuan Dynasty attempt to restore Trần Ích Tắc as King of Annam, Trần Ích Tắc continued to live in Ezhou, Hubei.\n- Trần Ích Tắc ultimately died on foreign soil.",
